---
description: Guardrails and workflow for the billing agent
alwaysApply: true
---
- Never add a customer_id parameter to any tool. The customer id comes from ctx.
- Do arithmetic and anomaly detection in code, not in the model.
- Any change to agent behavior needs a new or updated case in CASES (or TOOL_CHECKS for validation in code).
- Run `npm test` after every change and report the result.
- Never write API keys into files other than the gitignored .env. Use environment variables.
- See AGENTS.md for commands and the project map.
